# `changelog.py release` keeps every entry of [Unreleased] when a
# subsection repeats (#596): [Unreleased] held Added, Changed, Added,
# Changed, Added, Fixed, and the move kept only the last block of each
# name, which lost 78 of the 271 entries of CHANGELOG.md without an error.
# The blocks of one name are now joined in file order, ahead of the entries
# that the section of the version already holds, and the move stops before
# it writes unless the new section holds every entry.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && split-file %s %t
# RUN: cd %t/repeated && %python %S/../../scripts/release/changelog.py release 9.9.9 2026-10-26
# RUN: FileCheck --check-prefix=MOVED --match-full-lines %s < %t/repeated/CHANGELOG.md
# RUN: cd %t/lost && not %python %S/../../scripts/release/changelog.py release 9.9.9 2026-10-26 2>&1 \
# RUN:   | FileCheck --check-prefix=LOST %s
# RUN: cmp %t/lost/CHANGELOG.md %t/lost-original.md

# MOVED: ## [Unreleased]
# MOVED-EMPTY:
# MOVED-NEXT: ## [9.9.9] - 2026-10-26
# MOVED-NEXT: ### Added
# MOVED-EMPTY:
# MOVED-NEXT: - Added one.
# MOVED-NEXT: - Added two,
# MOVED-NEXT:   on two lines.
# MOVED-NEXT: - Added three.
# MOVED-NEXT: - Added four.
# MOVED-NEXT: - Added before, in 9.9.9.
# MOVED-EMPTY:
# MOVED-NEXT: ### Changed
# MOVED-EMPTY:
# MOVED-NEXT: - Changed one.
# MOVED-NEXT: - Changed two.
# MOVED-EMPTY:
# MOVED-NEXT: ### Fixed
# MOVED-EMPTY:
# MOVED-NEXT: - Fixed one.
# MOVED-EMPTY:
# MOVED-NEXT: ## [0.1.0] - 2026-10-04
# MOVED-EMPTY:
# MOVED-NEXT: ### Added
# MOVED-EMPTY:
# MOVED-NEXT: - The first.
# MOVED-EMPTY:
# MOVED-NEXT: [Unreleased]: https://github.com/vv137/mdir/compare/v9.9.9...HEAD
# MOVED-NEXT: [0.1.0]: https://github.com/vv137/mdir/releases/tag/v0.1.0
# MOVED-NEXT: [9.9.9]: https://github.com/vv137/mdir/releases/tag/v9.9.9

# An entry outside a subsection is not moved: the count stops the move,
# and the file is left as it was.
# LOST: CHANGELOG.md: [Unreleased] and the section of 9.9.9 hold 2 entries, but the new section would hold 1: nothing is written

#--- repeated/CHANGELOG.md
# Changelog

## [Unreleased]

### Added

- Added one.
- Added two,
  on two lines.

### Changed

- Changed one.

### Added

- Added three.

### Changed

- Changed two.

### Added

- Added four.

### Fixed

- Fixed one.

## [9.9.9] - unreleased

### Added

- Added before, in 9.9.9.

## [0.1.0] - 2026-10-04

### Added

- The first.

[Unreleased]: https://github.com/vv137/mdir/compare/v0.1.0...HEAD
[0.1.0]: https://github.com/vv137/mdir/releases/tag/v0.1.0
